{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ef59740ae2e0c99250d886b8f161b4d9aa851c4d4d92e548c0862bbfa56841d6", "ja": "ギブミー！　メタファー！", "zh": "给我！　隐喻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "86b000907e0cb548cc0d58bc781e4a96b6529d9ae510fc57b24961adefe3dddf", "ja": "（……。同じことを2回叫んでいる……。\nこういう時の青羽さんは、ちょっと怖いんだけど……）", "zh": "（……已经在喊同样的话2次了……青羽小姐在这种时候，真有点可怕啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e427cf6bc0f8892248a9c59083f84bd139104f88d650d6db33022986e68a7eac", "ja": "（いや、でも連絡事項だけは伝えないとな……。\n意を決して、ええい！）", "zh": "（不，不过至少得把该交代的事情传达出去才行……。下定决心，豁出去了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "35ad4a9b101e62b85e2121b6123c3ade998c9f232a3540899f3039d59bbd40c1", "ja": "お、お疲れさまです青羽さん。自分はこれから\n事務所の方に向かいますので……それじゃ。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛、辛苦了。我接下来要去事务所那边……那就先这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "d37c59e1756e5b9fbc98cd186e28a8676c1d18e6722c1f30e4f2ac35740fef04", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです。{$P$}さん。\n……ああっ！　ちょっと待ってください！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。{$P$}先生。\n……啊！请等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "59b0a737897d57d18a19744812af6e94ea8fa31e0fb23c7d2a690f0f601f7862", "ja": "な、なんでしょう……？", "zh": "您、您有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "f4909f3cc1402f63f884b6427300e13871f4234562faf229eb331ca030db563e", "ja": "えっと……。\n今日のネクタイの柄、素敵ですね……！", "zh": "那个……。\n您今天领带上的图案真好看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "32adfa9437abc713504970b6ae277e926eee94c58d76b5102b3c586af78462a5", "ja": "ああ、これは取引先からいただいたんです。\n屏風がモチーフとかで、裏も凝ってるんです。", "zh": "啊，这是合作方送给我的。\n听说图案是以屏风为主题，连背面也设计得很用心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "343b663d2ef88c9560532c4d401ced8c18916dca9327705195e0e97dc44ccb55", "ja": "屏風！　……そうか、和の方向もあるよね。\n……裏と表、一対にして……風神と雷神みたいな！", "zh": "屏风！……原来如此，也有和风这个方向呢。\n……正反两面，凑成一对……就像风神和雷神那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "1d79161012dd1a3cde41fc0e47feec5d3099ebdcbc09319727d2d1cb4abd2c50", "ja": "あ、あのっ！　私ちょっとアイディアを\nまとめるので、デザインノートをとってきます！", "zh": "啊，那个！我先整理一下思路，这就去拿设计笔记！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "60e09e0958cdf1f8128791fbbb1857cd541208546449c7578552c47bd776dba1", "ja": "は、はい！　いってらっしゃ～い！", "zh": "好、好的！慢走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "db42b896bf67b5516db7db1667868fc454859adcc055c347b509fa19b580023f", "ja": "……。\n事務所に向かって大丈夫そうかな……。", "zh": "……。\n去事务所应该没问题吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "2989c80a49d9d7247e666b1549712861d3dd751214f7b611ae60f530e7bde250", "ja": "音無君、ネクタイはこちらの柄の方がいいん\nじゃないかな。これは少し地味な気がしてね……。", "zh": "音无，我觉得领带还是选这个花纹比较好。这个感觉有点朴素了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "cc325d5aac2db410920eb0caea31c16626c22e92ace0fa7ba691d66e68199999", "ja": "それだと派手すぎます！　シックでダンディな方が\n社長にはお似合いですから。", "zh": "那样太花哨了！沉稳又时髦的款式才更适合社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "7ede311912b1d33294b5c648db1872dacf4f4223bf1cab498abd57e9d9a8af21", "ja": "そ、そうかね？　音無君がそういうなら……\nおや、君！　よく来てくれたね！", "zh": "是这样吗？既然音无这么说……\n哎呀，是你啊！谢谢你特意过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "47504ebd90db581a440f46a91a0c1feef1867e56f458a14898dc3b66fe70e48b", "ja": "あら！　お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "哎呀！辛苦了，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e960f238b37277fadc08227f4161b91dc426cca471b4b4aab4886d0a27915276", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。ずいぶん熱心に\nネクタイ選びをされてましたけど……？", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了。您们刚才挑领带挑得那么认真……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "2e4e20a44df3639bb39279a151fcd19c3f67ca441647ab97ea4421cefe024622", "ja": "ふっふっふ。またもドラマ出演の機会をいただいて\nしまったからね。気合いを入れなくては！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿。又一次得到了出演电视剧的机会，可不能不打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a205820193e41f7440df1ddd9281539363b0873d2b441295a10c2b5ac2ba4cb3", "ja": "ドラマ出演の機会、ですか？", "zh": "是出演电视剧的机会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "d5657930e5dfa628cf89825e2bd4d4386b9f65f7a880a646a9581a01d696b01b", "ja": "以前、急に出られなくなった役者さんの代役で、\n社長がドラマに出演したことがありましたよね？", "zh": "以前，有位演员突然无法出演，社长曾经代替他出演过电视剧，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "2c144a89c800f2f782c1bbf01495672cceb96a1f63bc27043772b938903e671f", "ja": "好評だったので、もしよければ今回もぜひって。\nそれでずっとこんな調子なんです。", "zh": "因为反响很好，对方就说如果可以的话，这次也务必请社长出演。\n所以他一直都是这个状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "151cce29ee158b6323672048f43dc615b731670b6a1296c2fb085972f8cbf03c", "ja": "『階のスターエレメンツ』の時ですね。\nん？　待ってください、今回もということは……。", "zh": "是《阶的明星元素》的时候吧。\n\n嗯？请等一下，也就是说这次也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "dd500e39f6e25a076d31c1c225a1ac65c508c9963e011f32fe5b3c25028fc8c0", "ja": "うむ！　『階のスターエレメンツ』、\nスペシャル版の制作が決定した！", "zh": "嗯！《阶之STAR ELEMENTS》，\n已决定制作特别版！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "d5954de1cc753ffb7dec472fac8e5946ca35ac80a33b8f33db5e3ca3da971aca", "ja": "国内最大のオーディション、\nアイドルニューウェーブに挑む3人……。", "zh": "挑战国内最大规模选拔赛\n“偶像新浪潮”的3个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "6de6e06a717583e22c2999a7eb5dc6cbbb5a729297713613db19926840e0b719", "ja": "天羽光駆、神崎水桜、草薙星蘭……\nアイドルを目指す3人のお話ですね！", "zh": "天羽光驱、神崎水樱、草薙星兰……\n是3个以偶像为目标的人的故事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8e42574a6c92af1dfd30b0eecfe797191136b53a2ddf3afec7f8a757034c28d1", "ja": "ええ。あのドラマは、\n根強いファンが多いんですよね。", "zh": "嗯。那部电视剧有很多忠实粉丝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7219c312d5d4e3f74cc08419a8b7aac711e2010d1b33f1d2bdf7247a50ff85f0", "ja": "続編なら、前作のリバイバル放送は必須ですね。\n再販できるグッズも考えないと……。", "zh": "如果要拍续集，前作的重播是必不可少的。还得考虑一下哪些周边可以再版销售……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "b0b1d8f5233ea5fd22c07a807d2dd11a87e72f55d98ac2ca6a336192c249ad2e", "ja": "うむ！　ここはやはり、\n君に任せるのが正解のようだ。", "zh": "嗯！看来交给你\n果然是正确的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "287ba810d1958abe6bcd01b11212d424ef9f25ac7e5a73dbe8e06c0accfbcebc", "ja": "『階のスターエレメンツ』スペシャル版、\n今後の進行は君に一任する！", "zh": "《阶的明星元素》特别版，今后的进展就全权交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_1030", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d3845971a9557ad69bd172369a43527f50662529b1b3b9af1f9f01d01514223c", "ja": "もちろんです！\n早速、企画書を確認しますね！", "zh": "当然可以！\n我这就确认企划书！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "bc5aa66190758956e1d3bca7fa4b3d4d36f7797ba6a1189255c43371e0a122bc", "ja": "はっはっはっ、頼もしい限りだ！\nおお、そうだ。ついでと言ってはなんだが……。", "zh": "哈哈哈哈，真是可靠啊！\n哦，对了。既然顺便提一句……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "61afd0f4a20d65c4b1cd4ab0dc6e27273e17cbc6635f1b153f2fe856eebf5301", "ja": "私がドラマで着けるネクタイも、\n君が選んでくれないかね？", "zh": "我在剧里戴的领带，\n能不能也让你来帮我挑选呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "44ed00f6f797f99767036275db20a8077d95ce68ad04e2090d9e2d02a5e81058", "ja": "え、自分でいいんですか？", "zh": "诶，让我自己选真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "cafe0ffbeaa97dcceb9b5423723c1cd0141b62c6ce358cd4fd0fc9b0702244d7", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、センスも\nバッチリでしょうしね。お任せしちゃいます！", "zh": "既然是{$P$}先生，品味肯定也没问题。就交给你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0359_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0359_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "878d68a817f3e2bd84ecb8f6b05df297edc45e5a1ac4038686e8880a51c11264", "ja": "うむ！　よろしく頼んだよ～！", "zh": "嗯！那就拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
